WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
A world to learn in. Personal choice. Visual thinking. Work that lasts.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Space The same lesson pathway, inside a different world.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Magic Forest A complete student theme: navigation, materials, and progress.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Neon Hacker A cleaner technical style. The student chooses.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Make the connections. Select an item. Choose its match. Complete the set.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Keep the work. Submit the answer. Review the result. Keep the version.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Read it back. The saved version keeps the pairs together.
